Third-party files
=================

Adapters under adapters/ include files copied byte for byte from creators'
repositories, at the commit pinned in each adapter's vendored-upstream.json.
Those files keep their creators' copyright and licence. The MIT licence of this
repository does not cover them. Most adapters carry the upstream LICENSE or
NOTICE beside the copied files.

